  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "冬頭"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Siā Tsùn-siông</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">見若冬頭稻仔割好，大埕就有規堆規堆ê粟，暗時驚凍露水iah是落雨lóng tio̍h用雨帆khàm--leh。透早天lio̍h-lio̍h仔拍phú光ê時，阿公kah阿爸就開始耙粟，兩人一對手，uì粟堆kā粟仔耙落大埕，披--開thang好曝粟。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿母kā早起煮好就huah阿公in入來食早起，阮兜ê早起tsiânn簡單，有煎卵包、菜脯、塗豆kah甜甜ê豆枝，上重要--ê是ài煮飯，bē-tàng kûn糜。聽阿母講，冬頭ê時tsūn，早起若是糜tī桌頂，阿公lóng ē使性地bē giàn食，甘願khai錢去樹仔跤hia食油飯。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿爸kah阿公leh食早起ê時，阿母就ē hiu我kah大姊去大埕，攑粟耙kā粟仔耙做一股一股，等目nih仔阮三人一人顧一區，一股一股勻勻仔píng，kā下跤tâm ê粟píng起來曝日。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家lóng知冬頭ê時tsūn，日頭tng mé是ē咬--人--ê，阮tiānn-tiānn hōo日頭公曝kah燒燙燙，giông-giông beh褪一重皮，跤底mā燒kah叫m̄敢。上可憐--ê是「走西北雨」，冬頭曝粟走西北雨是tsiânn sù常ê代誌，he就真正是緊張兼刺激。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過晝仔便若看西爿有leh烏，就知liam-mi ē落雨，ài趕緊收粟khàm雨帆。阿母lóng ē大聲hiu叫阮做意致緊耙耙--leh，「等--leh若收無過手，lín皮就繃khah ân--leh！」真創治--人，拄收好、雨就煞、日頭koh出--來--ah！仝款ài koh kā粟披--開。正港像阿公講--ê，作穡人是看天食飯。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">冬頭若過，大埕就闊lòng-lòng。哈哈！Tsit時ê大埕就是阮囡仔tshit-thô ê好場所。Tshiáng箍螺、跳索仔、彈樹奶、tiak珠仔、bih-sio揣、踢銅管仔kah bā-hio̍h掠雞仔囝……。Tsia-ê kah囡仔伴做伙sńg ê種種記持，到tann iáu深深印tī我ê心內，見若tshuā囡仔tńg舊厝，我好親像lóng ē看著我家己leh耙粟ê影跡。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">編註：台灣早冬ê稻仔差不多tī舊曆5、6--月ê時割稻。</div></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3y0uPNP9_SzHCVDm9nUJ03-pJO5nIykPc2-rDwtNTErLr8vpyWJmq-kV3QWgkw-nluGZqoIct2w6x0yQK2XHpbd_SqjfGAUW78ALDby_tn1YY3PU8b_avaHy4JQA_7cOP_XIiHNQSycnHU7fGEfTi3WBoPIqdr1Vd9caqgQDvmXQbEOg1w2hhfc_rtU03/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3y0uPNP9_SzHCVDm9nUJ03-pJO5nIykPc2-rDwtNTErLr8vpyWJmq-kV3QWgkw-nluGZqoIct2w6x0yQK2XHpbd_SqjfGAUW78ALDby_tn1YY3PU8b_avaHy4JQA_7cOP_XIiHNQSycnHU7fGEfTi3WBoPIqdr1Vd9caqgQDvmXQbEOg1w2hhfc_rtU03/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/s1424/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SP